  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get Volunteer Feedback Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single volunteer feedback submission by its unique identifier.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires 'read' permission
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                        |
  |-----------|--------|----------|------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the feedback submission    |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete volunteer feedback record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                      | Type     | Description                                                     |
  |----------------------------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                         | string   | UUID primary key.                                               |
  | firstName                  | string   | Volunteer's first name.                                         |
  | surname                    | string   | Volunteer's surname.                                            |
  | programVolunteered         | string   | Programme the volunteer participated in.                        |
  | specificProgramDetails     | string   | Specific programme details (nullable).                          |
  | volunteerDuration          | string   | Duration of volunteering (nullable).                            |
  | overallExperienceRating    | number   | Overall experience rating (1–5).                                |
  | roleClarityRating          | number   | Role clarity rating (1–5).                                      |
  | teamSupportRating          | number   | Team support rating (1–5).                                      |
  | organizationRating         | number   | Organization rating (1–5).                                      |
  | programMadeImpact          | string   | Whether the programme made an impact (nullable).                |
  | waysProgramHelped          | string[] | Ways the programme helped (nullable).                           |
  | activitiesInvolvedIn       | string[] | Activities the volunteer was involved in (nullable).            |
  | skillsDeveloped            | string   | Description of skills developed (nullable).                     |
  | skillsGained               | string[] | Skills gained through volunteering (nullable).                  |
  | enjoyedMost                | string   | What the volunteer enjoyed most (nullable).                     |
  | challengesExperienced      | string   | Challenges experienced (nullable).                              |
  | improvementSuggestions     | string   | Suggestions for improvement (nullable).                         |
  | continueVolunteering       | string   | Whether the volunteer would continue (nullable).                |
  | wouldRecommend             | string   | Whether the volunteer would recommend the programme (nullable). |
  | additionalComments         | string   | Any additional comments (nullable).                             |
  | submissionDate             | string   | Date of form submission (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                         |
  | updatedAt                  | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                   |
  | createdAt                  | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                          |
  | deletedAt                  | string   | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                      |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
